  "notes": "Modern scholarly chapter providing a direct critical control for the Laws of Lipit-Ištar at the chapter's 573–602 editorial coordinate. Bibliographic sources conflict: CDLI reports 2014 and 455–612; JSTOR and the volume contents report 455–616; Wilcke's corrigenda say 2014, published 2015, and 455–616; the BAdW bibliography reports 2015 and 455–633. These states are preserved for reconciliation against an inspected Edition. The DOI identifies the chapter route.",
